## Improvements

- [GLOBAL] The YOLO image sets `http_proxy`/`HTTPS_PROXY` and routes even `127.0.0.1` curl through tinyproxy, which returns `403 Filtered` — every future mock-API test that spins up a local fixture server must export `NO_PROXY=127.0.0.1,localhost` (and `no_proxy`) or the first metadata fetch silently 403s. Discovered via a full debug session; should be a standing rule in `~/.claude-yolo/CLAUDE.md` so prompt authors pre-write it into harnesses.
- [GLOBAL] hideGit's masked `.git` breaks `Makefile.variables` (`ROOTDIR ?= $(shell git rev-parse --show-toplevel)` → empty → `include /common.env` fails), so `make test`/`make precommit` die at the include stage. The gate only works as `ROOTDIR=/workspace make precommit` (the `?=` honors the env var). Prompts' `<verification>` blocks should state this invocation or the rule belongs in the hideGit container notes — otherwise every container re-derives it.
- [GLOBAL] This container runs zsh, where `${PIPESTATUS[0]}` is empty (it's `$pipestatus`, 1-indexed) — verification commands that pipe `make … | tail` and report `${PIPESTATUS[0]}` print a blank exit code. Capture via `cmd > log 2>&1; code=$?` instead.
